WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.233
The Ansoff matrix maps four ways to grow.

00:00:03.283 --> 00:00:05.002
Penetration sells more to the same market.

00:00:05.052 --> 00:00:08.033
Market development finds new markets,

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:09.919
product development makes new products,

00:00:09.969 --> 00:00:12.298
and diversification does both.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.684
Picture Allen's lollies.

00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:17.172
Penetration means more of the lolly aisle.

00:00:17.222 --> 00:00:20.202
Selling nostalgia to adults is market development.

00:00:20.252 --> 00:00:23.742
Intense flavours for Gen Z is product development.

00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:27.626
Drinks would be diversification, the riskiest corner.

00:00:27.676 --> 00:00:31.215
So test it cheaply first, with a collaboration.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.112
Use it like this:

00:00:33.162 --> 00:00:34.739
put an option in each box,

00:00:34.789 --> 00:00:36.567
weigh the risk against the brand's strengths,

00:00:36.617 --> 00:00:38.650
and recommend one.
